# Novidades (owner only)

Hub Novidades is locked to the owner. Agents must **not** add, edit, reorder, or delete `HUB_NEWS` / `HUB_NEWS_DEFAULT` in `public/hub.js`, and must **not** publish to the Novidades sheet.

- Ship the feature. Leave the changelog to the owner.
- Still never mention Staff or Julioelboard/Prateleira in Novidades if you are ever asked to touch it.
